### Nim

Install Nim -- thoroughly explained here: http://nim-lang.org/download.html

Enter into readfile.nim:

    try:
      echo readFile("hello.txt")
    except:
      echo "Problem reading file."

Run command 'nim c readfile.nim' then './readfile'

### Package Management in Nim

The `nimble` command handles packages in Nim.  Please read the excellent and thorough documentation here: https://github.com/nim-lang/nimble

For more information, see the great documentation at http://nim-lang.org/documentation.html, the new book Nim in Action, https://www.manning.com/books/nim-in-action, or many other resources online such as those listed here: http://nim-lang.org/learn.html
